    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34223" root="فعو or فعى" body-key="f">
    
      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تفعّى</span></b>  <i>He</i> (a man, S) <i>became like the viper</i>
(<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الأَفْعَى</span>, S, K) <i>in evil:</i> (S, TA:) or, as in the A,
<i>he made himself to resemble the viper</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَشَّبَهَ بِالأَفْعَى</span>)
<i>in the evilness of his disposition.</i> (TA.)

